{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T17:48:37.895Z","level":"WARN","service":"3dgalaxy-backend","environment":"development","module":"HTTP","message":"Slow API Warning: HTTP PUT /api/products/3f1d99fe-2fcc-4c1a-94ae-623e77376e23 took 2561ms (threshold: 1500ms)","errorCode":"SLOW_API_RESPONSE","metadata":{"requestId":"req_msoyf3pa_hokx","userId":"8e73170e-35ba-470e-94b5-498e6189bd7e","route":"/api/products/3f1d99fe-2fcc-4c1a-94ae-623e77376e23","method":"PUT","statusCode":200,"durationMs":2561,"metadata":{"body":{"name":"Anycubic Photon Mono M7 Max 3D Printer","slug":"anycubic-photon-mono-m7-max-3d-printer","brand":"ac20995a-cd2b-4183-a53c-4f4ef658a9e5","category_id":"818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d","sku":"anycubic-photon-mono-m7-max-3d-printer","barcode":"1786******326","mrp":89999,"sale_price":"89999","dealer_price":"89999","stock":5,"description":"<h6 class=\"text-main fw-small\">Product Features</h6>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>Maximum print speed of 4 Sec. per layer (0.05mm layer height)</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>LighTurbo 3.0 High-Precision Light Source System</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>Intelligent Release 2.0 Precision Control</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>14.7L Ultra-Large Print Volume</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>20-40C Resin Temperature Control, Resin Auto-Recycling Management</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>8 User-Friendly lmprovements<br><br></p>\n<div role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"feature\" aria-expanded=\"true\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#feature\" class=\"accordion-title\">\n<span>Features</span><span class=\"icon icon-arrow-down\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"collapse show\" id=\"feature\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body widget-desc\">\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul class=\"item\">\n<li>【Huge Build Volume】 Anycubic Photon Mono M7 Max offers a spacious printing size of 298mm × 164mm × 300mm, allowing for the creation of full-size masks, intricate game terrains, detailed cosplay props, and various models without the hassle of cutting and assembling</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul class=\"item\">\n<li>【Upgraded Light Source】 LighTurbo 3.0 combines a COB light source and Fresnel lens and factory calibrate technology can reach the light angle within 3°, and light uniformity is more than 90%. With the anti-aliasing feature activated and paired with high-precision positioning lead screws, it effectively minimizes layer lines and aliasing to achieve a higher level of precision</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul class=\"item\">\n<li>【Speedy and Convenient】 The Photon Mono M7 reaches a maximum speed of 60mm/h thanks to intelligent release 2.0. A 200% speed increase comparing to the previous M3 Max printer. In addition, the flip-open cover design upports one-hand opening and hovering angles anywhere greater than 45°that can save time and space</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul class=\"item\">\n<li>【Resin Management Features】 Dynamic temperature control resin vat will adjust the temperature of the resin material to maintain the optimal print temperature at all times for print success. And resin auto-fill feature allows for automatic filling and one-key recycling of remaining resin. Release film uses integrated design for easier replacement</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul class=\"item\">\n<li>【User-Friendly Improvements】After printing is completed, the model can be suspended above the platform with a small angle, allowing the resin to flow back into the resin vat. And a bigger resin vat with 1300ml volume for large models<br><br>\n<div role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"specification\" aria-expanded=\"true\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#specification\" class=\"accordion-title\">\n<span>Specifications</span><span class=\"icon icon-arrow-down\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"collapse show\" id=\"specification\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body widget-material\">\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<b>Build volume :</b><span> </span>298mm*164mm*300mm</li>\n<li>\n<b>Printing volume :</b><span> </span>14.7L</li>\n<li>\n<b>Build platform :</b><span> </span>Laser engraving aluminum alloy</li>\n<li>\n<b>Operating screen :</b><span> </span>4.3</li>\n<li>\n<b>Printer Gross Weight :</b><span> </span>28.8 kg</li>\n<li><b>Printer Diamension 76.5x52x49 cm :</b></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br><img height=\"451\" width=\"451\" alt=\"Anycubic Photon Mono M7 Max 3D Printer\" src=\"https://www.3idea.in/assets/images/products/1740562911-5-711Wt+8auWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg.jpg\"><br><img src=\"https://www.3idea.in/assets/images/products/1740562911-4-719UDPCoP2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg.jpg\" width=\"453\" height=\"453\"><br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","long_description":"<h6 class=\"text-main fw-small\">Product Features</h6>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>Maximum print speed of 4 Sec. per layer (0.05mm layer height)</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>LighTurbo 3.0 High-Precision Light Source System</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>Intelligent Release 2.0 Precision Control</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>14.7L Ultra-Large Print Volume</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>20-40C Resin Temperature Control, Resin Auto-Recycling Management</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>8 User-Friendly lmprovements<br><br></p>\n<div role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"feature\" aria-expanded=\"true\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#feature\" class=\"accordion-title\">\n<span>Features</span><span class=\"icon icon-arrow-down\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"collapse show\" id=\"feature\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body widget-desc\">\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul class=\"item\">\n<li>【Huge Build Volume】 Anycubic Photon Mono M7 Max offers a spacious printing size of 298mm × 164mm × 300mm, allowing for the creation of full-size masks, intricate game terrains, detailed cosplay props, and various models without the hassle of cutting and assembling</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul class=\"item\">\n<li>【Upgraded Light Source】 LighTurbo 3.0 combines a COB light source and Fresnel lens and factory calibrate technology can reach the light angle within 3°, and light uniformity is more than 90%. With the anti-aliasing feature activated and paired with high-precision positioning lead screws, it effectively minimizes layer lines and aliasing to achieve a higher level of precision</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul class=\"item\">\n<li>【Speedy and Convenient】 The Photon Mono M7 reaches a maximum speed of 60mm/h thanks to intelligent release 2.0. A 200% speed increase comparing to the previous M3 Max printer. In addition, the flip-open cover design upports one-hand opening and hovering angles anywhere greater than 45°that can save time and space</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul class=\"item\">\n<li>【Resin Management Features】 Dynamic temperature control resin vat will adjust the temperature of the resin material to maintain the optimal print temperature at all times for print success. And resin auto-fill feature allows for automatic filling and one-key recycling of remaining resin. Release film uses integrated design for easier replacement</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul class=\"item\">\n<li>【User-Friendly Improvements】After printing is completed, the model can be suspended above the platform with a small angle, allowing the resin to flow back into the resin vat. And a bigger resin vat with 1300ml volume for large models<br><br>\n<div role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"specification\" aria-expanded=\"true\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#specification\" class=\"accordion-title\">\n<span>Specifications</span><span class=\"icon icon-arrow-down\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"collapse show\" id=\"specification\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body widget-material\">\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<b>Build volume :</b><span> </span>298mm*164mm*300mm</li>\n<li>\n<b>Printing volume :</b><span> </span>14.7L</li>\n<li>\n<b>Build platform :</b><span> </span>Laser engraving aluminum alloy</li>\n<li>\n<b>Operating screen :</b><span> </span>4.3</li>\n<li>\n<b>Printer Gross Weight :</b><span> </span>28.8 kg</li>\n<li><b>Printer Diamension 76.5x52x49 cm :</b></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br><img height=\"451\" width=\"451\" alt=\"Anycubic Photon Mono M7 Max 3D Printer\" src=\"https://www.3idea.in/assets/images/products/1740562911-5-711Wt+8auWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg.jpg\"><br><img src=\"https://www.3idea.in/assets/images/products/1740562911-4-719UDPCoP2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg.jpg\" width=\"453\" height=\"453\"><br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","images":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443880999-284585613.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443880910-120033344.jpg","ht